# Extension Security

- Session timeout: 10 min inactivity, centralized in useSessionTimeout
- Reset on mouse/keyboard/touch/scroll
- Update AUTHENTICATED_SCREENS when adding authenticated screens
- Lock flow: clear in-memory state -> clear cached key -> navigate to lock screen
- Never log password/mnemonic/keys
- Strict CSP: script-src 'self'
- Env vars must use VITE_* prefix
